url: 'https://github.com/gojiplus/rowvoi'
repository: 'https://github.com/gojiplus/rowvoi'
abstract: >-
  RowVoi provides tools for interactive disambiguation of
  rows in a dataset using value-of-information policies.
  Given a small set of candidate rows, it determines which
  columns must be observed to distinguish them, using both
  deterministic weighted set cover and probabilistic
  epsilon-relaxed approaches, and which single column to
  acquire next under a cost budget. It implements exact,
  greedy, ILP and metaheuristic minimal key finding, mutual
  information-based feature selection, and adaptive policies
  that respond to observations. The same two engines are
  exposed for retrieval-augmented generation: selecting a
  minimal set of retrieved chunks that supports the claims an
  answer requires, choosing the clarifying question that best
  resolves an ambiguous result set, and sequencing retrieval
  probes by expected information gain.
